        <p class="opacity-75 leading-relaxed">ul. Marcina Kromera 7B/34<br/>85-790 Bydgoszcz</p>
        <p class="font-bold mt-3 text-white/90">NIP: 5542730312<br/>REGON: 545677545</p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
